        <p>COMMISSIONERS CLAUSES ACT, 1847. RUNCORN IMPROVEMENT ACT. 1852. NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that a MEETING of Persons entitled to VOTE at the Election ,cf Com- missioners under the Runcorn Improvement Act will be held at the MARKET HALL, Bridge- I. Runcorn, on THURS- DAY, the 7th d y of September, 1893. for the election of Five Commissioners in th.,, place of the five raft ng. The votiqg will commence at nine o'clock in the forenoon and close at four o'clock in the at tern oon. E. MARSHALL, Secretary to the ssid Commissioners. Town Hall. Runcorn, August 24th 1893. COMMISSIONERS CLAUSES ACT, 257. RUNCORN IMPROVEMENT, ACT 1852. NOTICE IS HEREBY GIVEN that at a MEETING of the Runcorn Improvement Commissioners held on the 3rd day of August, 1893, FIIANCIS WIS WALL, Esq., was appointed to act as the Returning Officer at the Election of Commissioners to be held on the 7th day of September, 1893. B. MARSHALL, Secretary to the said Commissioners. Town Hall, Runcorn, August 24th, 1893.</p>
